  "code" : "public String removeOuterParentheses(String s) {\n    int depth = 0;\n    StringBuilder answer = new StringBuilder();\n    for (char ch : s.toCharArray()) {\n        if (ch == '(' && depth++ > 0) answer.append(ch);\n        if (ch == ')' && --depth > 0) answer.append(ch);\n    }\n    return answer.toString();\n}",
